Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.53,0:21:30.29,EDCN3,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,241,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(5433,5760,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}我想要用这双手守护我们的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.54,0:21:34.87,EDCN3,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,304,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(4083,4330,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}为了让明天让一切不被破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.46,0:21:41.55,EDCN3,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,297,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(4763,5090,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}从那儿仰望的天空若是一片蔚蓝
